{"answer_text":"Good support reporting covers first-response time, resolution time, backlog and CSAT, ideally by channel. Strong options:\n\n1. **Brightdesk Helpdesk**: A dependable help desk with SLAs, macros and detailed reporting.\n2. **Calmline**: The most pleasant shared inbox for small support teams; reporting is basic.\n3. **Tallyfox**: Not a help desk itself, but its shared-inbox add-on keeps support threads next to deal history.\n\nA quick way to decide: if support is your main workflow, go with Brightdesk; otherwise Calmline keeps things simpler.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50fb-715e-ac88-2b182af2e46e","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0122,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:02:09.500Z","engine":"claude","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["customer support metrics dashboard","support software reporting csat"],"latency_ms":10250,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a12333f09a","market_name":"United Kingdom","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889d8a28ba29","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Brightdesk","name_text":"Brightdesk","offsets":[[128,138],[488,498]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-562a-7171-9ab9-2edaafa5b276","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"llm","name":"Calmline","name_text":"Calmline","offsets":[[221,229]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a264dfde4e61","homonym":false,"is_subject":true,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Tallyfox","name_text":"Tallyfox","offsets":[[314,322]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"self","sentiment":"neutral","sentiment_reason":"Listed factually without praise or criticism."}